# Blog photo originals — the camera and phone files the webp conversions in the
# same folders were made from. Kept locally so a frame can be re-cropped without
# re-shooting; never committed. Only the .webp is imported by src/data/blog.ts,
# and these run to 150MB+, which in git history is permanent.
src/assets/blogs/**/*.jpg
src/assets/blogs/**/*.JPG
src/assets/blogs/**/*.jpeg
src/assets/blogs/**/*.JPEG
src/assets/blogs/**/*.mp4
src/assets/blogs/**/*.MP4
